 in hair and makeup  mandy blames sterling justin and chris  sullivan for making her laugh the most  and i can't laugh with those prosthetics  oh that's right we're  like ripping your face off totally  exactly but it's hard to avoid disaster  with prosthetics on because it's not the  only thing that can send her back to the  makeup chair  sometimes a few tears can make her face  start to melt which when you imagine it  is a little less this is us and a lot  more  american horror story this is us  has also had some problems with mother  nature milo recalls one  onset moment when everyone was watching  mandy and sterling film an emotional  scene outside  when suddenly sterling had to stop to  point out that a bird had pooped on  mandy's hat  hold on i know you're in the zone but a  bird  just defecated on your head but mandy's  a pro  so after being ushered off stage for a  quick hat change she popped back into  the scene like nothing happened  and then they popped right back in the  moment i'm like oh my god i would have  lost i would have lost my mind  speaking of mandy her tv hubby has  nothing but good things to say  but we're not surprised our favorite  on-screen couple  who have the impressive superpower of  making us go from laughter to tears and  back again  all within a two-minute scene have the  most fun when they're on camera together  milo and mandy who we'll refer to as  eminem from now on because they're so  delicious  gush about each other all the time  you're  protective and you're practical like  what's a better word for kind you're the  team leader  thank you milo says mandy is just as  nice as she seems but she's also hard on  herself  as for milo mandy says he's the best  co-star and awesome tv dad  but he has the biggest potty mouth  apparently he drops f-bombs so often  they should start a swear jar  as for eminem's best kept behind the  scenes secret that would be their candy  stash which they always keep attached to  their chairs in case they need a  scene pick me up it's not like nuts and  dried fruits no no no no  no no it's like the hardcore sugar stuff  yeah the two are also great at  collaborating on things that aren't  acting  like when they showed off their musical  skills to glamour by wrapping the fresh  prince theme song  i looked at my kingdom i was finally  there to sit on my throne as the prince  of bel air  it might seem like all laughs but you're  definitely wondering how this cast isn't  constantly in tears having to portray  such heartbreaking moments  why don't you take a guess about which  castmate cries the most on set  the cast consensus is in and it's  definitely mandy moore  but mandy's also a goofball behind the  scenes she even uses rebecca's pregnancy  belly as her own portable table for  on-set lunches and script reviews  it's all about practicality people  eminem aren't the only two with an  unbreakable bond  justin and sterling are man crushing on  each other all the time  according to justin sterling's the  show's real heartthrob  sterling humbly disagrees complimenting  justin on his white teeth  perfectly quaffed hair and says that  touching him it's like brushing up  against a rock  oh my god we'd definitely like to find  that last one out for ourselves  to bond the pearson bros have started a  push-up challenge meant to resemble the  one jack does with randall when he's a  kid  milo and sterling gave it a go and then  justin had to get in on the action  feel free to drop a heart in the  comments if you wish you were up next  toby is definitely not to be excluded  from the brotherly bonding  in fact chris sullivan and justin can't  stop cracking each other up behind the  scenes  and sometimes on camera justin says he  often breaks character with chris  because they do a lot of ad-libbing in  one scene where kevin admits that he  hasn't seen notting hill there are  outtakes of toby shaking him and  freaking out in disbelief which led to  justin breaking character more than 